<title>BANGLADESH: Dhaka building collapse kills five, injures many.</title>
<headline>Dhaka building collapse kills five, injures many.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>At least five people were killed and several injured when a six-storey building under construction collapsed in Dhaka on Monday, police said.</p>
<p>The victims were members of one or two families already occupying a portion of the building, police said.</p>
<p>No other details were immediately available.</p>
</text>
